    "description": "Outlets Rush: So Addictive, You'll Forget Your Shoe Size!\r\n\r\nTransform into the ultimate retail tycoon in Outlets Rush \u2013Dive into the strategic time management gameplay and become the boss of your personalized shopping city. Play now for an immersive experience that combines tycoon mastery, idle thrills, and mega shopping excitement!\r\n\ud83c\udfe9 Tap, Build, Repeat:\r\nIn this idle game, simplicity is key! Tap your way to success as you build and expand your outlets from mini to mega. It's easy, it's fun, and it's all about the joy of watching your mall grow with minimal effort!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Various Stores & Products:\r\nExplore iconic sports shops, luxury stores, and a plethora of items found in real outlets - shoes, clothes, bags, hats, underwear, and more. Each store brings a unique concept and a delightful variety of items for your customers to discover.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcbc Effortless Management:\r\nBecome a retail tycoon without breaking a sweat! Effortlessly manage your dream mall by hiring staff and making strategic decisions. Deal with displaying goods, cleaning fitting rooms, and helping customers check out. Fear not, for you can build your own dream team and manage them efficiently, turning challenges into opportunities and making every coin count!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf07 Mini to Mega, Instantly:\r\nExperience the joy of instant growth as you transform mini outlets into mega shopping extravaganzas in the blink of an eye. It's the managerial journey you've been waiting for, with surprises around every corner!\r\n\r\nDownload Outlets Rush now and let the idle shopping mania begin! \ud83c\udf1f\ud83d\uded2\ud83c\udfae",
